  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan tilføjer en vægtet vest under zone 2 gåture og vandreture for at øge aksial knoglebelastning sikkert.",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan kalder telefonen den værste udløser for dårlig kropsholdning. Hold den i øjenhøjde, og sæt også toppen af ​​din skærm i øjenhøjde.",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan kalder dette teknisk og blev lært det for sin egen diagnosticerede tilstand. Vær blid, og stop, hvis du får svimmelhed, prikken eller hovedpine.",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Bryan demo med tidsstempel",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan demonstrerer det på {time} ({clock})",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan gjorde 1 × 10 i 2023. Hans Galpin-session i 2025 inkluderer nordiske krøller i styrkeblokken. De beskytter mod forstrækninger i baglåret.",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan laver \"sommerfugletræk\" med et modstandsbånd, 1 × 15. De fleste opskrifter beskriver det som en brystflue; se hans klip for at kopiere hans nøjagtige version.",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan laver 3 × 10 pr. ben, lært af Ben Patrick, Knees-Over-Toes-træneren, der arbejder med ham på hans 2026 dunk-projekt. Det bygger den indre quad (VMO) og knæspændstighed.",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan gør begge greb",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan gør begge dele. Hans Galpin-session i 2025 inkluderer dem i styrkeblokken ved 2 × 5-8. Hans officielle begynderliste bruger assisterede pull-ups.",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan laver Pallof-pressen i sin session i 2025 med Dr. Andy Galpin. Det træner bagagerummet til at modstå vrid.",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan laver tibialis-rejsninger (1 × 25, enkeltbens på listen). Hans dunknoter fra 2026 nævner begrænset ankeldorsalfleksion. Denne øvelse virker på den bevægelse.",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan har trænet til dunk som 49-årig siden juli 2026 ved at bruge tunge løft med hop mellem sæt. Han siger, at han har brug for flere fast-twitch-fibre og hurtigere styrkeudvikling, og advarer om Achilles-risiko fra landingsstyrker. Lær at lande, før du arbejder i højden.",
