  "The app includes recordings for every voice. Download the selected voice once to save it for playback; a speech model is only needed if the shared recordings are missing.": "Appen inkluderer optagelser for hver stemme. Download den valgte stemme én gang for at gemme den til afspilning; en talemodel er kun nødvendig, hvis de delte optagelser mangler.",
  "The app includes recordings for every voice. Turn coaching on to save the selected voice for playback. A speech model is only needed if the shared recordings are missing.": "Appen inkluderer optagelser for hver stemme. Slå coaching til for at gemme den valgte stemme til afspilning. En talemodel er kun nødvendig, hvis de delte optagelser mangler.",
  "The app no longer starts a full translated-voice download when you switch language.": "Appen starter ikke længere en fuld oversat stemme-download, når du skifter sprog.",
