  "This timer is complete. You can log it now.": "Denne timer er færdig. Du kan logge det nu.",
  "This voice has not been cached yet. Select it to start its one-time preparation.": "Denne stemme er ikke blevet cachelagret endnu. Vælg den for at starte dens engangsforberedelse.",
